WEBVTT

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:31.704
you can't sell black actors
abroad outside of the US,

00:06:31.996 --> 00:06:34.954
the consequences of that are apocalyptic
in terms of like

00:06:34.996 --> 00:06:38.996
the actual valuing of black lives
in America and around the world.

00:06:38.996 --> 00:06:43.204
Because we make fewer black movies, we
don't market those movies abroad,

00:06:43.371 --> 00:06:46.288
you know, and it's just fundamentally
not true.

00:06:46.288 --> 00:06:48.621
Stacy Smith, a professor at USC,

00:06:48.829 --> 00:06:55.288
ran the numbers and found that basically
when you support movies with diversity

00:06:55.413 --> 00:06:59.079
in at the same level, that you support
movies that don't have that diversity,

00:06:59.079 --> 00:07:00.788
guess what? They make the
same amount of money.